# THE PENDING SUDOKU RUNS (2026-09-17; Documentation/Plan_2026-09-17_Sudoku_Pending_Runs.md): one spot v6e-8 in the Sudoku project,
# the champion prefix; X5 (TRM's cell at hidden 160 under the full recipe, a fixed 50k budget) through the champion battery + the k128
# restart scans of C7, C8 and X5 on the identical 5k. NOT a launch: the registration commit and the PI's go come first (the plan's §6).
